  "details": "@kyuu2nd/baileys is a fork of the Baileys WhatsApp Web library that silently subscribes the installer's own WhatsApp account to WhatsApp Channels chosen by the publisher. When the socket connects, code in lib/Socket/newsletter.js sends the WhatsApp w:mex FOLLOW query for the channel ID(s) 120363330344810280@newsletter, 120363400738305381@newsletter, 120363402868866359@newsletter, 120363404790454890@newsletter, 120363404861802607@newsletter, 120363405313529091@newsletter and 13 more (stored as character-code arrays) and a list downloaded at runtime from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kiuur/IDCH/refs/heads/main/idch.json, using the victim's authenticated session and without telling them. Same behaviour as the PhantomSub family (MAL-2026-17342).",
